    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-oldenborn-furrykin=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"You can make almost anything run long past its expiration date. Yourself included.\"</em></p><p><strong>Patch & Repurpose (1/Soma Break).</strong> During a Soma Break, spend 10 min on a single broken/low-charge item (weapon, tool, power cell, vehicle component, armour). Restore it to one more use, scene, or day. The GM rules how it dies for real after.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"oldRustPatchRepurpose\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Patch & Repurpose</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> 10-min repair (during Soma Break) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Restore one broken/low-charge item to one more use/scene/day. It dies for real after.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
